1
00:00:58,720 --> 00:00:59,560
Go after him!

2
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,080
Don't run!

3
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,080
Officer Cao.

4
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:12,980
Teng Xiaohu is trying to kill someone with a gun.

5
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:30,250
Where is he, Brother Hu?

6
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,840
Split up!

7
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:33,700
You go this way.

8
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,080
Wang Hong!

9
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,960
Get out here!

10
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,000
Teng Xiaohu!

11
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,080
Teng Xiaohu!

12
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:05,560
Don't run!

13
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:08,360
Wang Hong, you still have a backup plan?

14
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:11,560
Wang Hong!

15
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,640
Xiao Ma, go after Teng Xiaohu.

16
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:14,240
Okay.

17
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:17,320
Wang Hong!

18
00:03:19,079 --> 00:03:19,800
Wang Hong!

19
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:24,280
Xiao Ma.

20
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,800
How is it?

21
00:03:26,720 --> 00:03:27,360
I lost him.

22
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,490
Command Center,

23
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,880
this is Cao Jin from the Criminal Investigation Brigade.

24
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,000
At Beishan Hunting Ground,

25
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,480
Teng Xiaohu escaped with a gun.

26
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:41,540
I'm requesting a city-wide manhunt.

27
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,200
Yes.

28
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,640
Notify the Forest Protection Section

29
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:45,200
and the brothers patrolling nearby

30
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:46,560
to help us find the missing persons,

31
00:03:46,560 --> 00:03:47,890
Wang Hong and Li Xuefei.

32
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:49,880
Wang Hong and Li Xuefei.

33
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:50,760
Yes, yes.

34
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,130
As soon as possible.

35
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:52,800
Let's go.

36
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:01,360
We've checked almost everywhere.

37
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,620
Let's retreat for now.

38
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:04,760
Maybe they're not even in this area.

39
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:06,760
It's cold in the mountains at night.

40
00:04:06,760 --> 00:04:07,720
If we retreat,

41
00:04:07,720 --> 00:04:09,320
what if something happens to them?

42
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:10,120
Keep looking.

43
00:04:11,400 --> 00:04:11,930
Brother.

44
00:04:19,320 --> 00:04:20,120
Li Xuefei!

45
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,560
Li Xuefei!

46
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,280
Wake up, Li Xuefei!

47
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:24,760
Li Xuefei!

48
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:28,050
Are you okay, Li Xuefei?

49
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:29,560
Li Xuefei!

50
00:04:32,320 --> 00:04:33,120
Are you okay?

51
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:36,400
Gangzi.

52
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:37,800
Come give me a hand.

53
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,200
Coming.

54
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,330
Carry her to the car.

55
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:41,680
Help him up.

56
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,240
Come on.

57
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:43,240
Let's go.

58
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:45,320
Put the coat on.

59
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:08,080
What is it?

60
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,240
According to the technical department's report,

61
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:20,170
the fatal wound on Liu Ming's chest

62
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:22,920
has an irregular shape

63
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:25,520
with signs of tearing and squeezing on the edges.

64
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:26,600
A piece of pine board was found at the scene.

65
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,320
A piece of pine board was found at the scene.

66
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:27,400
A piece of pine board was found at the scene.

67
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:28,120
The murder weapon is inferred

68
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,850
to be this kind of flat-headed,

69
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,040
sharp metal object.

70
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,400
Gloves.

71
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,620
Then this might be the murder weapon.

72
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:41,500
This is too much of a coincidence.

73
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:49,970
It really is a coincidence.

74
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:53,320
Ma,

75
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:56,120
take all these things back to the bureau

76
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:59,120
for detailed comparison and trace examination.

77
00:05:59,120 --> 00:05:59,880
Pack them carefully.

78
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:00,720
I understand.

79
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:09,800
You're really careless.

80
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:10,840
Why did you provoke him?

81
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:12,370
Didn't you know he had a gun?

82
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,240
So what if he has a gun?

83
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,040
I'm perfectly fine.

84
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,000
I didn't get hurt, did I?

85
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:16,280
That's called luck.

86
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,290
Don't do this again.

87
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,000
Got it.

88
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,640
Go home.

89
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,100
The door is locked.

90
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,840
Chen Lu,

91
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,120
come out!

92
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:53,520
Come out and pay us back! Hurry up!

93
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,200
Chen Lu,

94
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:55,600
pay us back!

95
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:56,740
Let's smash it!

96
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:57,650
Smash it!

97
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,480
Chen Lu, come out!

98
00:07:10,080 --> 00:07:10,680
Boss Chen.

99
00:07:11,440 --> 00:07:14,040
The payment for the last batch of goods is three days overdue.

100
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,520
So many of our guys are waiting to get paid.

101
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:17,580
How long are you going to put this off?

102
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:21,880
You begged us with tears in your eyes to supply the goods first,

103
00:07:21,880 --> 00:07:22,800
saying you were tight on money

104
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,330
and had cash flow problems.

105
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:25,800
Considering our friendship in the industry,

106
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,880
we trusted you.

107
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:29,680
Now the goods have been out for half a month. Where's the money?

108
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,740
Where is the money?

109
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,120
Bosses.

110
00:07:32,840 --> 00:07:34,960
I, Chen Lu, have been in business for so many years.

111
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,490
You all know my reputation.

112
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:39,000
You know I never make empty promises.

113
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,080
Originally, once the school order

114
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,440
was paid and settled...

115
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:45,480
I could have cleared the last batch of payments immediately,

116
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,409
not a penny less.

117
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:48,120
But the raw material supply cutoff

118
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:49,640
was an unexpected situation.

119
00:07:49,640 --> 00:07:52,240
Of the three suppliers who agreed to reserve goods for me,

120
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,880
two turned around and said the goods were fully booked,

121
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:57,140
and one directly raised the price by 30%.

122
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:59,080
My factory is short of funds.

123
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:01,450
I really can't handle this situation.

124
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,640
I still haven't figured out

125
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,120
why the raw materials

126
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,440
suddenly ran out.

127
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:09,400
Stop making those lame excuses.

128
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,720
How many days have we given you?

129
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,760
I don't care.

130
00:08:12,760 --> 00:08:14,160
If I don't see the money today,

131
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,280
I'll smash this broken factory

132
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:16,400
to pay off the debt.

133
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,480
You can ask for money,

134
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:20,040
but don't you dare touch the factory.

135
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,360
This is a society ruled by law.

136
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,080
With this kind of behavior,

137
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:24,080
I'll sue you for picking quarrels and provoking trouble.

138
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:26,080
We'll see who ends up in jail.

139
00:08:26,080 --> 00:08:27,280
Little girl,

140
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:28,400
what do you know?

141
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,320
Adults are talking business.

142
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:30,640
Kids shouldn't interrupt, hear me?

143
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:32,559
My mom isn't intentionally delaying payment.

144
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:34,760
Someone is blocking the raw materials.

145
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,360
What's the use of you blocking this place every day?

146
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,440
If you block my mom here,

147
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,200
no one can communicate with the timber merchants.

148
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:40,799
The problem won't be solved,

149
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:41,960
just wasting time like this every day.

150
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,620
Let's see who can outlast who.

151
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:44,960
This little brat,

152
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,600
such a smart mouth.

153
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,720
You're quite tough.

154
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:48,120
What the hell do you know?

155
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,400
Do you know how many people under me

156
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:50,600
are waiting to eat?

157
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:52,920
I will definitely give you the money.

158
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:54,440
But I really can't get it right now.

159
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,080
I...

160
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,800
If I had a way,

161
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:59,880
I wouldn't make things difficult for everyone.

162
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:00,440
I can wait,

163
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:02,200
but can my brothers wait?

164
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:04,320
Chen Lu, you remember this.

165
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,440
If I don't see the money today,

166
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:07,440
you can say goodbye to this factory.

167
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,360
Hear me?

168
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,120
What are you doing?

169
00:09:10,120 --> 00:09:11,120
If you want money,

170
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:13,120
I don't have a penny.

171
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:16,400
Selling the factory isn't a one- or two-day thing.

172
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,640
Please give me a little more time.

173
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:19,570
Just three days.

174
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,780
Is three days okay?

175
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,560
If I can't give you the money,

176
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:26,120
you don't have to do anything.

177
00:09:26,120 --> 00:09:28,320
I'll chop off my own hand to pay the debt.

178
00:09:29,160 --> 00:09:29,960
As for selling the factory,

179
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,120
don't worry, I'll sell it myself.

180
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,250
I absolutely won't owe anyone a penny.

181
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,120
Three days,

182
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,360
just three days.

183
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:38,210
Don't touch my factory,

184
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:40,240
and don't bully my daughter.

185
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:42,720
I will definitely give everyone a satisfactory answer.

186
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,400
Fine,

187
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:46,420
we'll trust you one more time.

188
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:47,920
Three days.

189
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:51,120
If we don't get a result in three days...

190
00:09:55,520 --> 00:09:56,520
Just three days.

191
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:57,760
If you don't pay by then,

192
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:59,020
we won't go easy on you.

193
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:02,960
They only know how to bully a widow and her child.

194
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,800
Mom, you shouldn't have stopped me.

195
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:06,660
I would have taught them a lesson.

196
00:10:07,920 --> 00:10:08,760
Enough.

197
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,440
Truth be told,

198
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:12,060
we are indeed in the wrong.

199
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,480
It's not easy for anyone.

200
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,200
If you really fought them,

201
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:18,330
do you think you'd have the upper hand?

202
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:21,160
But they shouldn't bully you like this.

203
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:23,040
The problem was with the raw materials.

204
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:25,370
Why did they have to yell and smash things?

205
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:26,400
Paying back debts is

206
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:27,520
only right and proper.

207
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,080
It's always been this way.

208
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:31,600
What exactly happened with the raw materials?

209
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,760
Wasn't it all settled before?

210
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:35,090
Why did they suddenly change their minds?

211
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:38,200
Is someone deliberately going against us?

212
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,720
Don't think about anything else.

213
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:40,960
Mom will handle it. Let's go.

214
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,920
Let's go get something to eat.

215
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:42,600
Let's go.

216
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:49,200
We'll talk about it when we get back to the station tonight.

217
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:49,800
Okay.

218
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:55,600
You've had a shock today.

219
00:10:56,040 --> 00:10:57,500
Go back and get a good rest.

220
00:10:57,720 --> 00:11:00,250
If you feel unwell, see a doctor immediately.

221
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:03,370
Thank you, Officer Cao,

222
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:04,600
for bringing me back.

223
00:11:04,960 --> 00:11:06,360
It's our duty.

224
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,720
But then again,

225
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,760
why were you there?

226
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:19,800
Mr. Wang and I got separated while running.

227
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:22,840
I don't know who hit me from behind,

228
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,600
and then I passed out.

229
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,960
Can you remember anything

230
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:30,240
from that time?

231
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:34,720
I passed out.

232
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:37,600
What about before you were knocked out?

233
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,200
I can't remember.

234
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:42,240
Okay.

235
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:45,880
Officer Cao,

236
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,860
is Mr. Wang still missing?

237
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,000
We've already sent people to look for him.

238
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,320
Wang Hong was last seen

239
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:53,240
being picked up by a tricycle.

240
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:54,480
The forest is too big,

241
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,880
and we are short-handed.

242
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:59,280
If Wang Hong calls you,

243
00:11:59,520 --> 00:12:01,180
or if you think of any details,

244
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:02,560
not just about Teng Xiaohu,

245
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:04,490
but anything you find suspicious,

246
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:06,210
contact me anytime.

247
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:08,080
Okay.

248
00:12:09,640 --> 00:12:10,280
By the way.

249
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:16,930
I originally used this to guard against Teng Xiaohu,

250
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,520
but it also recorded some things.

251
00:12:19,520 --> 00:12:21,320
I guess you might find it useful.

252
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:26,240
I'll listen to it when I get back.

253
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:27,800
Go back and rest early.

254
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:29,930
We'll contact you if we need anything.

255
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:31,320
Thank you.

256
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:33,880
Good night, Officer Cao.

257
00:12:47,920 --> 00:12:48,680
You're back.

258
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,080
Dad.

259
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:52,600
What's wrong?

260
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:55,000
Didn't you go to the Beishan Hunting Ground?

261
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,860
Something happened at the Beishan Hunting Ground.

262
00:12:59,240 --> 00:13:00,200
What happened?

263
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:02,490
And what happened to your hand?

264
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:03,560
Your arm hasn't even healed yet.

265
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:05,020
How did you get hurt again?

266
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,960
Mr. Wang refused to cooperate.

267
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:10,440
So Teng Xiaohu got angry.

268
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,920
He had a shotgun.

269
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:14,080
And he shot at us.

270
00:13:25,840 --> 00:13:27,360
Dad, where are you going?

271
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:28,720
I'm going to settle the score with that guy.

272
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:29,680
How dare he bully my daughter!

273
00:13:29,680 --> 00:13:31,720
The police are downstairs.

274
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:34,280
They brought me back.

275
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:37,480
The main thing is that Mr. Wang is still missing.

276
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:39,280
We got separated while running.

277
00:13:40,520 --> 00:13:42,180
What kind of business is this?

278
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,360
Are you doing business

279
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,560
or risking your life?

280
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:48,800
Sweetie,

281
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:50,800
Let's drop this deal, okay?

282
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:53,480
Even if something happens to Wang Hong,

283
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,010
it has nothing to do with us.

284
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:57,000
If something happens to him,

285
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,200
it won't just be about the deal anymore.

286
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:06,320
You cooked dumplings.

287
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:14,050
They are really delicious.

288
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:25,600
Hello, Officer Cao.

289
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:28,360
Is the person okay?

290
00:14:29,280 --> 00:14:30,410
I'll be right there.

291
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:32,450
Where are you going?

292
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,600
Dad, they found the person.

293
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:35,860
I have to go take a look.

294
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:37,600
The dumplings are quite good.

295
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:38,400
Eat some more.

296
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:39,360
I'll go with you.

297
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,200
No need.

298
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,040
Mr. Wang.

299
00:15:06,040 --> 00:15:09,240
When did you get this scar?

300
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:11,560
I was naughty when I was a kid.

301
00:15:12,560 --> 00:15:14,400
The doctor treated it very well.

302
00:15:14,840 --> 00:15:16,170
But it still left a mark.

303
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:17,400
What's wrong?

304
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:18,800
Nothing.

305
00:15:25,200 --> 00:15:25,920
Slow down.

306
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:28,480
Mr. Song, on New Year's Eve,

307
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:30,120
did a bald guy come here?

308
00:15:30,120 --> 00:15:31,960
A bald guy? No.
